{"3855660": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ironforged", "steam_appid": 3855660, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Earn Your Victory</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are <strong>no power fantasies</strong> here, no hand-holding. You fight with a <strong>minimal arsenal</strong>. Line up your shots, <strong>conserve ammo</strong>, control your breathing, and <strong>adapt under pressure</strong>. Every encounter tests your composure. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep beneath a collapsing world, a hidden facility manufactures and tests mechanized soldiers. <br><strong>You are CM-42</strong>. <strong>Endure </strong>and survive all<strong> 12 unique realms </strong>of the facility and <strong>earn deployment</strong>, <strong>or</strong> fail, and <strong>be melted down</strong> like all the failures before you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Time Warp</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use <strong>Time Warp</strong> to slow the battlefield <strong>and strike with precision.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855660/extras/dabf5efbbc47bcd45e6e3a86b8c95369.poster.avif?t=1785732471\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855660/extras/dabf5efbbc47bcd45e6e3a86b8c95369.webm?t=1785732471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855660/extras/dabf5efbbc47bcd45e6e3a86b8c95369.mp4?t=1785732471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Takedown</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Out of bullets? <strong>Take enemies down</strong> physically to <strong>regain the upper hand.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855660/extras/3d814db3e31d6e24fd0ff9913d69e369.poster.avif?t=1785732471\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855660/extras/3d814db3e31d6e24fd0ff9913d69e369.webm?t=1785732471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855660/extras/3d814db3e31d6e24fd0ff9913d69e369.mp4?t=1785732471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mag Handling</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manually</strong> eject rounds and <strong>reorganize your magazines.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855660/extras/9f5a99536299aa1f72bd290269ddcf95.poster.avif?t=1785732471\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855660/extras/9f5a99536299aa1f72bd290269ddcf95.webm?t=1785732471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855660/extras/9f5a99536299aa1f72bd290269ddcf95.mp4?t=1785732471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrades</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade to <strong>unlock</strong> new <strong>skills</strong>, then <strong>upgrade</strong> each <strong>individually.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855660/extras/8c263ecb795a67f2f0780a8dd43fd4bf.poster.avif?t=1785732471\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855660/extras/8c263ecb795a67f2f0780a8dd43fd4bf.webm?t=1785732471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855660/extras/8c263ecb795a67f2f0780a8dd43fd4bf.mp4?t=1785732471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Earn Your Victory</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are <strong>no power fantasies</strong> here, no hand-holding. You fight with a <strong>minimal arsenal</strong>. Line up your shots, <strong>conserve ammo</strong>, control your breathing, and <strong>adapt under pressure</strong>. Every encounter tests your composure. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep beneath a collapsing world, a hidden facility manufactures and tests mechanized soldiers. <br><strong>You are CM-42</strong>. <strong>Endure </strong>and survive all<strong> 12 unique realms </strong>of the facility and <strong>earn deployment</strong>, <strong>or</strong> fail, and <strong>be melted down</strong> like all the failures before you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Time Warp</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use <strong>Time Warp</strong> to slow the battlefield <strong>and strike with precision.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855660/extras/dabf5efbbc47bcd45e6e3a86b8c95369.poster.avif?t=1785732471\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855660/extras/dabf5efbbc47bcd45e6e3a86b8c95369.webm?t=1785732471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855660/extras/dabf5efbbc47bcd45e6e3a86b8c95369.mp4?t=1785732471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Takedown</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Out of bullets? <strong>Take enemies down</strong> physically to <strong>regain the upper hand.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855660/extras/3d814db3e31d6e24fd0ff9913d69e369.poster.avif?t=1785732471\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855660/extras/3d814db3e31d6e24fd0ff9913d69e369.webm?t=1785732471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855660/extras/3d814db3e31d6e24fd0ff9913d69e369.mp4?t=1785732471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mag Handling</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manually</strong> eject rounds and <strong>reorganize your magazines.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855660/extras/9f5a99536299aa1f72bd290269ddcf95.poster.avif?t=1785732471\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855660/extras/9f5a99536299aa1f72bd290269ddcf95.webm?t=1785732471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855660/extras/9f5a99536299aa1f72bd290269ddcf95.mp4?t=1785732471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrades</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade to <strong>unlock</strong> new <strong>skills</strong>, then <strong>upgrade</strong> each <strong>individually.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855660/extras/8c263ecb795a67f2f0780a8dd43fd4bf.poster.avif?t=1785732471\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855660/extras/8c263ecb795a67f2f0780a8dd43fd4bf.webm?t=1785732471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855660/extras/8c263ecb795a67f2f0780a8dd43fd4bf.mp4?t=1785732471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Slow-paced, tactical VR shooter where every mistake is punished. You fight with a minimal arsenal - your pistol, composure, timing, and precision. Wake up as CM-42 and fight your way out of a relentless combat training facility designed to break the weak and forge perfect soldiers.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855660/b6bb9b3c2b21063e6e81e080e92c086ba6251043/header.jpg?t=1785732471", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855660/626c95046fed88c60ad93bb432f98ec2b328bd48/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785732471", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855660/626c95046fed88c60ad93bb432f98ec2b328bd48/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785732471", "website": "https://ironforgedreams.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1070 - 8GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> OpenXR (PSVR2 not supported)<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> PSVR2 is not supported